/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tomasrgbsf/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"096c6b5f9b952c49389fd975515744074ba61317","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/commits/096c6b5f9b952c49389fd975515744074ba61317","html_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/commit/096c6b5f9b952c49389fd975515744074ba61317"}]},{"sha":"efb206f29317c3836da70b497f061a746fb9ad68","node_id":"C_kwDOTty1_doAKGVmYjIwNmYyOTMxN2MzODM2ZGE3MGI0OTdmMDYxYTc0NmZiOWFkNjg","commit":{"author":{"name":"Tomasrgbsf","email":"tomasbraynt@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-14T13:12:38Z"},"committer":{"name":"Tomasrgbsf","email":"tomasbraynt@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-14T13:12:38Z"},"message":"Fix MU1 source binding after audited verifier updates\n\nBind the unchanged MU1 research contract to the reviewed current pon_work\nsource. The native delta preserves the original W1 statement and adds\ncooperative task hashing, module exports and a private checked continuation.\nKeep all 16 cost cells unknown, all proof obligations open, and HOLD_NO_GO.\n\nThe original source mismatch and 16-test failure remain in audit receipts;\nthe 16 existing contract and negative controls pass after this one-pin fix.","tree":{"sha":"9f00bfc5637014a7a1e0ded31a08c214ed35f1db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/git/trees/9f00bfc5637014a7a1e0ded31a08c214ed35f1db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/git/commits/efb206f29317c3836da70b497f061a746fb9ad68","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/commits/efb206f29317c3836da70b497f061a746fb9ad68","html_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/commit/efb206f29317c3836da70b497f06