asrgbsf/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"2155d48d42854f672f5dbac84baffacdd01db16d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/commits/2155d48d42854f672f5dbac84baffacdd01db16d","html_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/commit/2155d48d42854f672f5dbac84baffacdd01db16d"}]},{"sha":"ecd0f270911f37f57d11e6a56da411832f56135a","node_id":"C_kwDOTty1_doAKGVjZDBmMjcwOTExZjM3ZjU3ZDExZTZhNTZkYTQxMTgzMmY1NjEzNWE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Tomasrgbsf","email":"tomasbraynt@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-14T13:16:54Z"},"committer":{"name":"Tomasrgbsf","email":"tomasbraynt@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-14T13:16:54Z"},"message":"Rebind joint research audit to reviewed current source\n\nThe listed 23-file source anchor drifted after reviewed native verifier,\nread-only forecast, and confirmation-integrity updates. Compare every pin\nto the original Git revision, review the three complete native deltas, and\nanchor the current map to the commit containing the MU1 pin repair.\n\nRetain all 18 unknown parameters, 13 open obligations, 16 unproved cost\ncells, and HOLD_NO_GO. Keep the independent checker map guard and expand\nthe existing revision-refusal control to reject the superseded anchor.\nUpdate the matching joint contract, checker and control blobs in the PQ corpus.","tree":{"sha":"c2c482d915308a07954196105f129d90b8c4cbd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/git/trees/c2c482d915308a07954196105f129d90b8c4cbd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/git/commits/ecd0f270911f37f57d11e6a56da411832f56135a","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TrillionniumFoundation/Trillionnium-Chain/commits/ecd0f270911f37f57d11e6a56da411832f56135a","html_url":"https://github.com/Tr